        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Veterinary Care for Homeless Pets in Teton Valley</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50778.webp" alt="Veterinary Care for Homeless Pets in Teton Valley" loading="lazy">
